 a\nsocket."],[216,"**`shalgalt-cv`** — fixture-driven detection tests under `tests/fixtures/`."],[215,"**`shalgalt-fileformat`** — `roundtrip` (write → read, encrypted and plaintext, streamed\n1 MiB entry, deterministic order, manifest-has-no-PII), `bad_passphrase`, and\n`forward_compat` (a `format_version` newer than supported is refused before any\ndecryption)."],[153,"**`stable`** — release branch. CI publishes from here. Never commit directly."],[418,"**200–300 DPI** хангалттай. Хэт өндөр DPI файлыг л томруулна, чанар нэмэгдэхгүй."],[160,"**Code and documentation are English** — every comment, doc comment, identifier, log\nmessage, error string, commit message, PR description, and Markdown file in the repo."],[192,"**Design** an OMR answer sheet in a visual editor (ArUco corner markers + bubble groups)."],[190,"**Developer documentation** (this section, English) — architecture, the Cargo workspace\nmap, how to build and run on each OS, the contribution workflow, the ADR index, and the\nHTTP API reference."],[161,"**End-user UI text is Mongolian** (Cyrillic) — page titles, buttons, labels, validation\nand toast messages, help text. UI strings come from the single string table at\n`src/lib/i18n/`; components never hard-code copy."],[321,"**Excel рүү гаргах** — дүнг хүснэгт болгон гаргах, эсвэл бүх төслийг `.shalgalt` файлаар хуваалцана."],[295,"**Excel рүү гаргах** товчоор дүнг `.xlsx` файл болгон татаж авна. Хүснэгтэд сурагчдын оноо,\nасуулт бүрийн үр дүн зэрэг багтана. Баганын гарчиг зэрэг бүх текст **монгол хэл**-ээр гарна."],[196,"**Export** results to Excel, or share a whole project as an encrypted `.shalgalt` file."],[193,"**Generate** a printable PDF of that sheet."],[194,"**Grade** stacks of scanned/photographed sheets offline using an OpenCV pipeline\n(adaptive threshold, auto-deskew, per-bubble confidence scoring)."],[122,"**Node** ≥ 20 and **pnpm** (the repo pins versions via `package.json` / `pnpm-lock.yaml`)."],[197,"**Offline-first.** No telemetry, 