en/docs/dev/architecture-13","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/architecture#stack","content":"Frontend"},"81":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture-14","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/architecture#stack","content":"SvelteKit 5 (adapter-static, SSG), Svelte 5 runes, TailwindCSS v4"},"82":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture-15","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/architecture#stack","content":"UI kit"},"83":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture-16","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/architecture#stack","content":"shadcn-svelte (bits-ui + tailwind-variants), `@lucide/svelte` icons"},"84":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture-17","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/architecture#stack","content":"Editor / UI"},"85":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture-18","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/architecture#stack","content":"svelte-konva (Canvas), paneforge (IDE panes)"},"86":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture-19","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/architecture#stack","content":"Native shell"},"87":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture-20","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/architecture#stack","content":"Tauri 2.0 + plugins: sql, dialog, fs, opener, log, single-instance, window-state, updater"},"88":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture-21","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/architecture#stack","content":"Core"},"89":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture-22","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/architecture#stack","content":"Rust — opencv-rust, pdfium-render, rust\\_xlsxwriter, printpdf"},"90":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture-23","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/architecture#stack","content":"Persistence"},"91":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture-24","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/architecture#stack","content":"`tauri-plugin-sql` + SQLite (a single file in Tauri's `app_data_dir`)"},"92":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture-25","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/architecture#stack","content":"Background API"},"93":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture-26","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/architecture#stack","content":"axum on `127.0.0.1:22345` (default; auto-fallback if busy)"},"94":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture-27","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/architecture#stack","content":"Async"},"95":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture-28","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/architecture#stack","content":"tokio (`full`)"},"96":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture-29","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/architecture#high-level-flow","content":"The desktop host (`apps/desktop`) is the only place that knows about Tauri. The four\n`crates/` are pure Rust and are reused by the standalone server (`apps/server`)."},"97":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture-30","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/architecture#the-four-hard-rules","content":"Every PR must respect these. They are the load-bearing invariants of the system."},"98":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture-31","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/architecture#rule-1--ipc-carries-path-strings-never-bytes","content":"Tauri commands take `pdf_path: String` / `image_path: String`, never image or PDF buffers.\nResult images are written to disk and the frontend loads them through the\n`asset://localhost/` protocol. This avoids the \"memory mirage\" where multi-hundred-MB scans\nwould be serialized across the IPC boundary. The `.shalgalt` reader/writer\n(`shalgalt-fileformat`) streams entries for the same reason — a project never lands in a\nsingle `Vec<u8>`."},"99":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture-32","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/architecture#rule-2--no-ui-freeze-on-batch-work","content":"Long-running work (grading a stack of sheets) runs in a `tokio::spawn`ed task. Progress is\nreported by emitting `task-progress` events with snake\\_case stage names\n(`TaskProgress` / `TaskStage` in `shalgalt-core::domain::progress`). The command thread\nreturns immediately."},"100":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture-33","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/architecture#rule-3--one-template-one-json-column","content":"`OmrTemplate` (markers + bubble groups + answer key) serializes as **a single JSON document**\ninto one `TEXT` column (`templates.json_schema`). It is never split into multiple columns or\ndenormalized. Coordinates are &#x2A;*normalized to `[0, 1]`** so a template works across DPIs and\npage sizes. The Rust struct (`shalgalt-core::domain::template`) and the TypeScript interface\n(`src/lib/types/`) are kept in sync by `ts-rs` codegen — never hand-edit the generated TS."},"101":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture-34","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/architecture#rule-4--the-axum-router-never-owns-its-lifecycle","content":"The `Router` and CORS layer are built in `shalgalt-core::api`. That crate never calls\n`axum::serve`, never binds a port, and never reads environment variables. The host owns the\nlifecycle: `apps/desktop` wraps the router in a `tokio::spawn` + oneshot graceful-shutdown\nharness; `apps/server` runs it as the process's main task. Routes are versioned under\n`/v1/`; breaking changes require a version bump and an ADR."},"102":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture-35","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/architecture#database-ownership","content":"All database access goes through `tauri-plugin-sql`. There is **no `sqlx` pool on the Rust\nside**. Migrations are defined in Rust (`apps/desktop/src/lib.rs`, SQL embedded via\n`include_str!`). The frontend reads and writes through `src/lib/db/*`. Rust commands never\ntouch the database: when a Rust task produces data that must be persisted (e.g. grading\nresults), it emits an event and the frontend writes it. The one exception is the standalone\nserver, which uses a separate read-mostly `rusqlite` `DataStore` in `shalgalt-store`\n(see ADR 0014)."},"103":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture-36","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/architecture#see-also","content":"Workspace map — what each crate and app owns."},"104":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture-37","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/architecture#see-also","content":"HTTP API reference — the `/v1/` surface."},"105":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture-38","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/architecture#see-also","content":"The per-crate `AGENTS.md` files are authoritative for module-shape decisions."},"106":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","type":"page","content":"Build & run","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Developer"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev/build"},"107":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-0","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/build","content":"System prerequisites and build/run commands for each OS."},"108":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-1","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev/build#build--run","content":"Build & run"},"109":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-2","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev/build#system-prerequisites","content":"System prerequisites"},"110":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-3","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev/build#debian--ubuntu","content":"Debian / Ubuntu"},"111":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-4","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev/build#macos-homebrew","content":"macOS (Homebrew)"},"112":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-5","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev/build#windows","content":"Windows"},"113":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-6","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev/build#pdfium-runtime-all-platforms","content":"pdfium (runtime, all platforms)"},"114":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-7","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev/build#toolchains","content":"Toolchains"},"115":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-8","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev/build#common-commands","content":"Common commands"},"116":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-9","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev/build#first-run","content":"First run"},"117":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-10","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev/build#running-the-standalone-http-server","content":"Running the standalone HTTP server"},"118":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-11","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/build#build--run","content":"shalgalt-omr depends on native libraries (OpenCV for the CV pipeline, pdfium at runtime,\nplus the platform webview toolkit for Tauri). Install the system prerequisites first, then\nthe JS and Rust toolchains."},"119":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-12","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/build#windows","content":"Per ADR 0001 the project uses the upstream OpenCV prebuilt self-extractor. LLVM\n(for opencv-rust's bindgen) ships with recent Visual Studio installs; otherwise install it\nfrom llvm.org."},"120":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-13","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/build#windows","content":"> Bumping OpenCV means updating three places: the snippet above, the `OPENCV_VERSION`\n> job-level env in `.github/workflows/ci.yml`, and ADR 0001."},"121":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-14","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/build#pdfium-runtime-all-platforms","content":"`pdfium-render` looks up the pdfium dynamic library at runtime. Download a release for your\nOS from bblanchon/pdfium-binaries and place\nit next to the executable, or extend `LD_LIBRARY_PATH` (Linux) / `DYLD_LIBRARY_PATH` (macOS)\n/ `PATH` (Windows). Release bundles ship pdfium as a bundled resource."},"122":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-15","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/build#toolchains","content":"**Node** ≥ 20 and **pnpm** (the repo pins versions via `package.json` / `pnpm-lock.yaml`)."},"123":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-16","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/build#toolchains","content":"**Rust** stable (`rustup`), with `cargo fmt` and `clippy` components."},"124":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-17","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/build#common-commands","content":"Command"},"125":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-18","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/build#common-commands","content":"Purpose"},"126":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-19","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/build#common-commands","content":"`pnpm install`"},"127":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-20","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/build#common-commands","content":"Install JS dependencies."},"128":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-21","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/build#common-commands","content":"`pnpm dev`"},"129":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-22","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/build#common-commands","content":"SvelteKit dev server only (browser, no Tauri webview)."},"130":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-23","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/build#common-commands","content":"`pnpm tauri dev`"},"131":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-24","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/build#common-commands","content":"Native window + Rust core (auto-runs Vite). The default flow."},"132":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-25","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/build#common-commands","content":"`pnpm check`"},"133":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-26","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/build#common-commands","content":"`svelte-kit sync` + `svelte-check`."},"134":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-27","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/build#common-commands","content":"`pnpm build`"},"135":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-28","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/build#common-commands","content":"Build SvelteKit assets (consumed by `tauri build`)."},"136":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-29","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/build#common-commands","content":"`pnpm tauri build`"},"137":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-30","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/build#common-commands","content":"Production native bundle."},"138":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-31","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/build#common-commands","content":"`pnpm generate-types`"},"139":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-32","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/build#common-commands","content":"Regenerate TS bindings from Rust (`cargo test -p shalgalt-core`)."},"140":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-33","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/build#common-commands","content":"Run these at the workspace root for the Rust side:"},"141":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-34","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/build#first-run","content":"On first launch the SQL plugin creates the SQLite file in the OS-specific data directory\n(e.g. Linux `~/.local/share/dev.filename.shalgalt-omr/`, macOS\n`~/Library/Application Support/dev.filename.shalgalt-omr/`) and applies migrations\nautomatically."},"142":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/build-35","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/build#running-the-standalone-http-server","content":"See the HTTP API reference for CLI flags, bind address, and auth behaviour."},"143":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","type":"page","content":"Contributing","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Developer"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing"},"144":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-0","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","content":"Branching model, commit conventions, language rules, and the PR checklist."},"145":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-1","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#contributing","content":"Contributing"},"146":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-2","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#branching-model","content":"Branching model"},"147":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-3","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#commit-conventions","content":"Commit conventions"},"148":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-4","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#language-rules-mandatory","content":"Language rules (mandatory)"},"149":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-5","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#the-four-hard-rules","content":"The four hard rules"},"150":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-6","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#adrs","content":"ADRs"},"151":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-7","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#pr-checklist","content":"PR checklist"},"152":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-8","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#continuous-integration","content":"Continuous integration"},"153":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-9","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#branching-model","content":"**`stable`** — release branch. CI publishes from here. Never commit directly."},"154":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-10","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#branching-model","content":"**`develop`** — integration branch. Feature PRs land here."},"155":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-11","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#branching-model","content":"**`feat/<phase>-<topic>`** — work branches off `develop`. One feature per PR."},"156":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-12","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#branching-model","content":"`session/*` branches are local isolation only and must never be pushed to the remote."},"157":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-13","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#commit-conventions","content":"Conventional Commits, one short imperative subject line:"},"158":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-14","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#commit-conventions","content":"Types: `feat`, `fix`, `refactor`, `docs`, `chore`, `test`, `perf`, `ci`."},"159":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-15","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#language-rules-mandatory","content":"Two languages, no overlap:"},"160":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-16","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#language-rules-mandatory","content":"**Code and documentation are English** — every comment, doc comment, identifier, log\nmessage, error string, commit message, PR description, and Markdown file in the repo."},"161":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-17","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#language-rules-mandatory","content":"**End-user UI text is Mongolian** (Cyrillic) — page titles, buttons, labels, validation\nand toast messages, help text. UI strings come from the single string table at\n`src/lib/i18n/`; components never hard-code copy."},"162":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-18","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#language-rules-mandatory","content":"`AppError.code` stays English (it is a stable identifier); the frontend maps the code to a\nMongolian message in the string table. A reviewer should treat any non-English string in\nsource or docs as a blocker, and any hard-coded user-facing string outside the i18n table\nas a blocker too."},"163":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-19","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#the-four-hard-rules","content":"A change is rejected if it violates any of the four architecture rules:\npath-strings-only IPC, no UI freeze on batch work, single-JSON template format, and the\nhost-owned axum lifecycle. When in doubt, read the relevant crate's `AGENTS.md`."},"164":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-20","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#adrs","content":"Architectural or operational decisions that are hard to reverse get an ADR under\n`docs/adr/` (`NNNN-kebab-title.md`, no gaps). Re-litigating a locked decision requires a new\nADR **plus** a master-plan update in the same PR. See the ADR index."},"165":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-21","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#pr-checklist","content":"Before requesting review:"},"166":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-22","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#pr-checklist","content":"`cargo fmt --all -- --check` is clean."},"167":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-23","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#pr-checklist","content":"`cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets --all-features -- -D warnings` is clean."},"168":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-24","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#pr-checklist","content":"`cargo test --workspace` passes (unit + integration + ts-rs export)."},"169":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-25","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#pr-checklist","content":"`pnpm check` passes (no Rust↔TS type drift)."},"170":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-26","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#pr-checklist","content":"New behaviour has tests; coverage target is 80%+."},"171":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-27","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#pr-checklist","content":"No non-English strings in code/docs; no hard-coded UI copy outside the i18n table."},"172":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-28","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#pr-checklist","content":"No secrets committed; the axum server still binds `127.0.0.1` by default."},"173":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-29","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#pr-checklist","content":"Branch is rebased on `develop` and conflicts are resolved."},"174":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-30","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#continuous-integration","content":"CI runs on every push to `develop`/`stable` and on PRs targeting them:"},"175":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-31","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#continuous-integration","content":"Job"},"176":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-32","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#continuous-integration","content":"Purpose"},"177":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-33","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#continuous-integration","content":"`web-check`"},"178":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-34","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#continuous-integration","content":"`pnpm install --frozen-lockfile`, `svelte-kit sync`, `pnpm check`."},"179":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-35","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#continuous-integration","content":"`rust-check`"},"180":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-36","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#continuous-integration","content":"apt deps → `cargo fmt --check` → `clippy -D warnings` → `cargo check`."},"181":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing-37","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/contributing#continuous-integration","content":"Both jobs must be green before merge. Release bundling (signed installers, pdfium download,\npackaging) and the updater manifest are handled by `release.yml` on `v*` tags. The\ndocumentation site is built and published to GitHub Pages by `docs.yml`."},"182":{"id":"/en/docs/dev","page_id":"/en/docs/dev","type":"page","content":"Overview","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Developer"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev"},"183":{"id":"/en/docs/dev-0","page_id":"/en/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev","content":"Developer documentation for shalgalt-omr — a local-first OMR grading IDE."},"184":{"id":"/en/docs/dev-1","page_id":"/en/docs/dev","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev#shalgalt-omr--developer-documentation","content":"shalgalt-omr — Developer Documentation"},"185":{"id":"/en/docs/dev-2","page_id":"/en/docs/dev","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev#what-it-does","content":"What it does"},"186":{"id":"/en/docs/dev-3","page_id":"/en/docs/dev","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev#core-principles","content":"Core principles"},"187":{"id":"/en/docs/dev-4","page_id":"/en/docs/dev","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev#where-to-start","content":"Where to start"},"188":{"id":"/en/docs/dev-5","page_id":"/en/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev#shalgalt-omr--developer-documentation","content":"shalgalt-omr is a **local-first OMR (Optical Mark Recognition) grading IDE**: a Tauri 2\ndesktop application with a SvelteKit frontend and a Rust core that grades scanned OMR PDFs\nfully offline, persists results in SQLite, and exposes an optional background HTTP API for\nintegrations."},"189":{"id":"/en/docs/dev-6","page_id":"/en/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev#shalgalt-omr--developer-documentation","content":"This site has two audiences:"},"190":{"id":"/en/docs/dev-7","page_id":"/en/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev#shalgalt-omr--developer-documentation","content":"**Developer documentation** (this section, English) — architecture, the Cargo workspace\nmap, how to build and run on each OS, the contribution workflow, the ADR index, and the\nHTTP API reference."},"191":{"id":"/en/docs/dev-8","page_id":"/en/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev#shalgalt-omr--developer-documentation","content":"**Хэрэглэгчийн гарын авлага** (the *User* section, Mongolian) — installation and\nday-to-day use of the application."},"192":{"id":"/en/docs/dev-9","page_id":"/en/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev#what-it-does","content":"**Design** an OMR answer sheet in a visual editor (ArUco corner markers + bubble groups)."},"193":{"id":"/en/docs/dev-10","page_id":"/en/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev#what-it-does","content":"**Generate** a printable PDF of that sheet."},"194":{"id":"/en/docs/dev-11","page_id":"/en/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev#what-it-does","content":"**Grade** stacks of scanned/photographed sheets offline using an OpenCV pipeline\n(adaptive threshold, auto-deskew, per-bubble confidence scoring)."},"195":{"id":"/en/docs/dev-12","page_id":"/en/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev#what-it-does","content":"**Review** low-confidence sheets bubble-by-bubble."},"196":{"id":"/en/docs/dev-13","page_id":"/en/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev#what-it-does","content":"**Export** results to Excel, or share a whole project as an encrypted `.shalgalt` file."},"197":{"id":"/en/docs/dev-14","page_id":"/en/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev#core-principles","content":"**Offline-first.** No telemetry, no crash reporting, no analytics. Nothing leaves the\nmachine unless the user explicitly exports it. The optional HTTP API binds to\n`127.0.0.1` by default."},"198":{"id":"/en/docs/dev-15","page_id":"/en/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev#core-principles","content":"**Two languages, no overlap.** All **code and documentation are English**; all\n**end-user UI text is Mongolian** (Cyrillic). See the language conventions in the repo\n`AGENTS.md`."},"199":{"id":"/en/docs/dev-16","page_id":"/en/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev#core-principles","content":"**Stable contracts.** Four hard rules (IPC path-strings only, no UI freeze on batch work,\na single-JSON template format, an axum router that never owns its own lifecycle) are\nenforced on every PR."},"200":{"id":"/en/docs/dev-17","page_id":"/en/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev#where-to-start","content":"New to the codebase? Read Architecture then the\nWorkspace map."},"201":{"id":"/en/docs/dev-18","page_id":"/en/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev#where-to-start","content":"Trying to build it? Jump to Build & run."},"202":{"id":"/en/docs/dev-19","page_id":"/en/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev#where-to-start","content":"Contributing a change? See Contributing and Testing."},"203":{"id":"/en/docs/dev-20","page_id":"/en/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev#where-to-start","content":"Integrating over HTTP? See the HTTP API reference."},"204":{"id":"/en/docs/dev-21","page_id":"/en/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev#where-to-start","content":"> The authoritative sources remain the repository's `AGENTS.md` files (one per crate) and\n> the master plan at `.claude/PRPs/plans/shalgalt-omr-master.plan.md`. This site condenses\n> them; where they disagree, the code wins for behaviour and the per-package `AGENTS.md`\n> wins for module-shape decisions."},"205":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/testing","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/testing","type":"page","content":"Testing","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Developer"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev/testing"},"206":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/testing-0","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/testing","content":"How the Rust and frontend test suites are organized and run."},"207":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/testing-1","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev/testing#testing","content":"Testing"},"208":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/testing-2","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev/testing#rust","content":"Rust"},"209":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/testing-3","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev/testing#frontend","content":"Frontend"},"210":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/testing-4","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev/testing#generated-artifacts-used-by-docs","content":"Generated artifacts used by docs"},"211":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/testing-5","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev/testing#coverage-target","content":"Coverage target"},"212":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/testing-6","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/testing#rust","content":"Unit tests live in `#[cfg(test)]` modules next to the code; integration tests live in each\ncrate's `tests/` directory (one binary per file). Run everything from the workspace root:"},"213":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/testing-7","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/testing#rust","content":"Notable suites:"},"214":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/testing-8","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/testing#rust","content":"**`shalgalt-core`** — `template_serde` round-trips an `OmrTemplate` against a golden\nfixture (`tests/fixtures/template-v1.json`), catching accidental Rule 3 schema breakage.\nThe grading engine has unit coverage for scoring, partial answer keys, and confidence\nbanding. The `/v1/` router is exercised in-process over a `MemoryStore` without binding a\nsocket."},"215":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/testing-9","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/testing#rust","content":"**`shalgalt-fileformat`** — `roundtrip` (write → read, encrypted and plaintext, streamed\n1 MiB entry, deterministic order, manifest-has-no-PII), `bad_passphrase`, and\n`forward_compat` (a `format_version` newer than supported is refused before any\ndecryption)."},"216":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/testing-10","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/testing#rust","content":"**`shalgalt-cv`** — fixture-driven detection tests under `tests/fixtures/`."},"217":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/testing-11","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/testing#frontend","content":"Unit tests cover utilities, data transforms, and stores. Type generation drift (Rust struct\nvs generated TS) surfaces as a `pnpm check` failure."},"218":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/testing-12","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/testing#generated-artifacts-used-by-docs","content":"Two examples produce artifacts the documentation consumes — they are also a lightweight\nsmoke test that the public APIs still compile:"},"219":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/testing-13","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/testing#coverage-target","content":"The repo targets &#x2A;*80%+** coverage on business logic. Prefer fixing the implementation over\nweakening a test; only change a test when the test itself is wrong."},"220":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","type":"page","content":"Workspace map","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Developer"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace"},"221":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-0","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","content":"The Cargo workspace — what each app and crate owns."},"222":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-1","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace#workspace-map","content":"Workspace map"},"223":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-2","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace#crate-responsibilities","content":"Crate responsibilities"},"224":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-3","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace#type-generation-ts-rs","content":"Type generation (ts-rs)"},"225":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-4","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace#workspace-map","content":"The repository is a Cargo workspace with a SvelteKit frontend at the root. Rust code lives\nunder `apps/` (host binaries) and `crates/` (pure libraries). A single `Cargo.lock` and\n`target/` live at the workspace root."},"226":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-5","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace#crate-responsibilities","content":"Crate / app"},"227":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-6","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace#crate-responsibilities","content":"Owns"},"228":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-7","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace#crate-responsibilities","content":"Must NOT contain"},"229":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-8","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace#crate-responsibilities","content":"`shalgalt-core`"},"230":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-9","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace#crate-responsibilities","content":"Domain types, grading, axum `Router`, `AppError`, xlsx, OpenAPI doc"},"231":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-10","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace#crate-responsibilities","content":"`tauri`, OpenCV, pdfium, port binding, env reads, DB code"},"232":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-11","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace#crate-responsibilities","content":"`shalgalt-cv`"},"233":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-12","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace#crate-responsibilities","content":"pdfium rasterization + OpenCV detection + confidence scoring"},"234":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-13","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace#crate-responsibilities","content":"Tauri, the axum router"},"235":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-14","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace#crate-responsibilities","content":"`shalgalt-pdf`"},"236":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-15","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace#crate-responsibilities","content":"printpdf rendering of a template to a printable sheet"},"237":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-16","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace#crate-responsibilities","content":"Tauri, OpenCV"},"238":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-17","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace#crate-responsibilities","content":"`shalgalt-fileformat`"},"239":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-18","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace#crate-responsibilities","content":"Streaming `.shalgalt` read/write, age crypto wrapper"},"240":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-19","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace#crate-responsibilities","content":"The `OmrTemplate` struct (lives in core), Tauri"},"241":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-20","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace#crate-responsibilities","content":"`shalgalt-store`"},"242":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-21","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace#crate-responsibilities","content":"`rusqlite` `DataStore` impl for the server"},"243":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-22","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace#crate-responsibilities","content":"The plugin-sql write path"},"244":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-23","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace#crate-responsibilities","content":"`apps/desktop`"},"245":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-24","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace#crate-responsibilities","content":"Tauri host: commands, migrations, axum spawn + shutdown harness"},"246":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-25","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace#crate-responsibilities","content":"Pure domain logic (delegate to crates)"},"247":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-26","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace#crate-responsibilities","content":"`apps/server`"},"248":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-27","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace#crate-responsibilities","content":"Standalone process: CLI args, bind, auth, CORS allow-list"},"249":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-28","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace#crate-responsibilities","content":"Re-implementing the router (reuse core's)"},"250":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-29","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace#crate-responsibilities","content":"Each Cargo member has its own `AGENTS.md` (with `CLAUDE.md` as a symlink) describing\npackage-specific rules and locked algorithmic decisions. Treat those files as authoritative\nfor anything inside that package."},"251":{"id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace-30","page_id":"/en/docs/dev/workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/dev/workspace#type-generation-ts-rs","content":"Domain models that cross the IPC boundary derive `ts_rs::TS` and export TypeScript\ninterfaces into `src/lib/types/generated/` when `cargo test -p shalgalt-core` runs. The\nfrontend script `pnpm generate-types` wraps the same command. A drift between the Rust struct\nand the generated TS fails `pnpm check` in CI — this is the mechanical enforcement of\nRule 3."},"252":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","type":"page","content":"Загвар засварлагч","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User Manual","Features"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/editor"},"253":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-0","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/editor","content":"Хариултын хуудасны загварыг визуал засварлагчид зохиох."},"254":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-1","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/editor#загвар-засварлагч","content":"Загвар засварлагч"},"255":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-2","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/editor#үндсэн-алхмууд","content":"Үндсэн алхмууд"},"256":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-3","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/editor#зөвлөмж","content":"Зөвлөмж"},"257":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-4","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/editor#загвар-засварлагч","content":"Засварлагч нь хариултын хуудасны **загвар** (template) зохиох газар юм. Загвар нь дараах\nхэсгүүдээс бүрдэнэ:"},"258":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-5","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/editor#загвар-засварлагч","content":"**Булангийн тэмдэг (ArUco)** — хуудасны 4 буланд байрлах бөгөөд програм хуудсыг танихад\nашиглана. Анхдагчаар бэлэн ирнэ."},"259":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-6","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/editor#загвар-засварлагч","content":"**Бөмбөлгийн бүлэг** — асуулт бүрийн сонголтын бөмбөлгүүд (жишээ нь A, B, C, D)."},"260":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-7","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/editor#загвар-засварлагч","content":"**Сурагчийн дугаар** ба **Хувилбар**-ын бүлэг (заавал биш)."},"261":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-8","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/editor#үндсэн-алхмууд","content":"**Хяналтын самбар → Шинэ загвар** дарж засварлагчийг нээнэ. Эсвэл одоо байгаа загвараа\nнээнэ."},"262":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-9","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/editor#үндсэн-алхмууд","content":"Шаардлагатай бол **дэвсгэр зураг** (хэвлэсэн хуудасны зураг/PDF) импортлон, түүн дээрээ\nбөмбөлгүүдээ тааруулна."},"263":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-10","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/editor#үндсэн-алхмууд","content":"**Бөмбөлгийн бүлэг нэмэх** товчоор асуултуудаа нэмж, тоо, зай, оноог тохируулна."},"264":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-11","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/editor#үндсэн-алхмууд","content":"**Хадгалах** дарна. **Буцаах / Дахих** (undo/redo) товчлуурууд дэмжигдэнэ."},"265":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-12","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/editor#үндсэн-алхмууд","content":"**PDF болгон гаргах** товчоор хэвлэхэд бэлэн хуудас үүсгэнэ."},"266":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-13","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/editor#үндсэн-алхмууд","content":"> 📷 &#x2A;Дэлгэцийн зураг: Засварлагчийн хэрэгслийн мөр (шинэ/нээх/хадгалах/буцаах/гаргах).*"},"267":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-14","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/editor#зөвлөмж","content":"Бүх координат **0–1 хооронд хувь**-аар хадгалагдах тул нэг загвар янз бүрийн хэмжээ,\nчанартай хэвлэлд тохирно."},"268":{"id":"/en/docs/user/editor-15","page_id":"/en/docs/user/editor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/editor#зөвлөмж","content":"Хэвлэхдээ масштабыг 100% байлгана — Хэвлэх зөвлөмж."},"269":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","type":"page","content":"Шалгалт удирдах","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User Manual","Features"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/exams"},"270":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams-0","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/exams","content":"Шалгалт үүсгэх, хариултын түлхүүр (хувилбар) оруулах."},"271":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams-1","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/exams#шалгалт-удирдах","content":"Шалгалт удирдах"},"272":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams-2","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/exams#шалгалт-үүсгэх","content":"Шалгалт үүсгэх"},"273":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams-3","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/exams#хариултын-түлхүүр-хувилбар-оруулах","content":"Хариултын түлхүүр (хувилбар) оруулах"},"274":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams-4","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/exams#тэмдэглэл","content":"Тэмдэглэл"},"275":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams-5","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/exams#шалгалт-удирдах","content":"**Шалгалт** нь нэг загвар дээр суурилсан, өөрийн **хариултын түлхүүр**-тэй нэгж юм. Нэг\nшалгалт олон **хувилбар**-тай байж болно (жишээ нь A, B хувилбар)."},"276":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams-6","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/exams#шалгалт-үүсгэх","content":"**Шалгалт** цэс рүү орно."},"277":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams-7","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/exams#шалгалт-үүсгэх","content":"**Шинэ шалгалт** дарж нэр өгч, ашиглах **загвар**-аа сонгоно."},"278":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams-8","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/exams#шалгалт-үүсгэх","content":"Үүссэн шалгалт жагсаалтад нэр, загвар, хувилбарын тоо, огнооны хамт харагдана."},"279":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams-9","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/exams#хариултын-түлхүүр-хувилбар-оруулах","content":"Шалгалтаа нээгээд хувилбар нэмнэ. Зөв хариултыг оруулах **хоёр арга**:"},"280":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams-10","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/exams#хариултын-түлхүүр-хувилбар-оруулах","content":"**Гараар** — асуулт бүрийн зөв хариултыг сонгоно."},"281":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams-11","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/exams#хариултын-түлхүүр-хувилбар-оруулах","content":"**Сканнердан уншуулах** — багшийн бөглөсөн нэг хуудсыг сканнердаж, програмаар уншуулаад,\nзэрэгцүүлэн шалгаж хадгална."},"282":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams-12","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/exams#хариултын-түлхүүр-хувилбар-оруулах","content":"> 📷 &#x2A;Дэлгэцийн зураг: Шалгалтын дэлгэрэнгүй — хувилбарын жагсаалт ба хариултын түлхүүр засах.*"},"283":{"id":"/en/docs/user/exams-13","page_id":"/en/docs/user/exams","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/exams#тэмдэглэл","content":"Хариултын түлхүүр нь тухайн шалгалтын **асуултуудын багц** юм. Хэрэв зарим асуултад түлхүүр\nоруулаагүй бол (хэсэгчилсэн шалгалт) тэдгээр асуултыг дүгнэхдээ алгасна."},"284":{"id":"/en/docs/user/export","page_id":"/en/docs/user/export","type":"page","content":"Excel рүү гаргах","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User Manual","Features"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/export"},"285":{"id":"/en/docs/user/export-0","page_id":"/en/docs/user/export","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/export","content":"Шалгалтын дүнг Excel хүснэгт болгон гаргах, дүнгийн жагсаалт үзэх."},"286":{"id":"/en/docs/user/export-1","page_id":"/en/docs/user/export","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/export#excel-рүү-гаргах-ба-дүн-үзэх","content":"Excel рүү гаргах ба дүн үзэх"},"287":{"id":"/en/docs/user/export-2","page_id":"/en/docs/user/export","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/export#дүнгийн-жагсаалт","content":"Дүнгийн жагсаалт"},"288":{"id":"/en/docs/user/export-3","page_id":"/en/docs/user/export","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/export#дэлгэрэнгүй-үзэх","content":"Дэлгэрэнгүй үзэх"},"289":{"id":"/en/docs/user/export-4","page_id":"/en/docs/user/export","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/export#excel-рүү-гаргах","content":"Excel рүү гаргах"},"290":{"id":"/en/docs/user/export-5","page_id":"/en/docs/user/export","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/export#дүнгийн-жагсаалт","content":"**Дүн** цэс нь хийгдсэн дүгнэлтүүдийн түүхийг харуулна. Та **загвар**-аар, мөн **шалгах\nшаардлагатай** эсэхээр шүүж, хуудаслан үзэж болно. Мөр бүр загвар, огноо, хуудасны тоо,\nшалгах шаардлагатай хуудасны тоог харуулна."},"291":{"id":"/en/docs/user/export-6","page_id":"/en/docs/user/export","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/export#дэлгэрэнгүй-үзэх","content":"Дүгнэлт сонгоход:"},"292":{"id":"/en/docs/user/export-7","page_id":"/en/docs/user/export","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/export#дэлгэрэнгүй-үзэх","content":"Зүүн талд **сурагч бүрийн оноо**-ны жагсаалт."},"293":{"id":"/en/docs/user/export-8","page_id":"/en/docs/user/export","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/export#дэлгэрэнгүй-үзэх","content":"Голд сонгосон сурагчийн **хуудасны зураг**, мета мэдээлэл, **асуулт тус бүрийн үр дүн**\n(зөв/буруу/хоосон)."},"294":{"id":"/en/docs/user/export-9","page_id":"/en/docs/user/export","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/export#дэлгэрэнгүй-үзэх","content":"> 📷 &#x2A;Дэлгэцийн зураг: Дүгнэлтийн дэлгэрэнгүй — сурагчийн жагсаалт ба асуултын задаргаа.*"},"295":{"id":"/en/docs/user/export-10","page_id":"/en/docs/user/export","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/export#excel-рүү-гаргах","content":"**Excel рүү гаргах** товчоор дүнг `.xlsx` файл болгон татаж авна. Хүснэгтэд сурагчдын оноо,\nасуулт бүрийн үр дүн зэрэг багтана. Баганын гарчиг зэрэг бүх текст **монгол хэл**-ээр гарна."},"296":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","type":"page","content":"Дүгнэх","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User Manual","Features"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/grading"},"297":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-0","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/grading","content":"Сканнердсан хуудаснуудыг багцаар автоматаар дүгнэх."},"298":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-1","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/grading#дүгнэх","content":"Дүгнэх"},"299":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-2","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/grading#алхмууд","content":"Алхмууд"},"300":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-3","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/grading#итгэлийн-оноо-ба-шалгах-шаардлага","content":"Итгэлийн оноо ба шалгах шаардлага"},"301":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-4","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/grading#зөвлөмж","content":"Зөвлөмж"},"302":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-5","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/grading#дүгнэх","content":"Дүгнэх дэлгэц нь сканнердсан буюу гар утсаар авсан хуудаснуудыг **багцаар** автоматаар уншиж\nоноо тавина."},"303":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-6","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/grading#алхмууд","content":"**Дүгнэх** цэс рүү орно."},"304":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-7","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/grading#алхмууд","content":"Сканнердсан &#x2A;*PDF файл(ууд)**-аа сонгоно (олон файл/олон хуудас дэмжигдэнэ)."},"305":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-8","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/grading#алхмууд","content":"Дүгнэх **шалгалт** ба **хувилбар**-аа сонгоно. Олон хувилбартай үед **автомат таних**-ийг\nидэвхжүүлж болно — хуудас бүрийн хувилбарын бүлгээс уншина."},"306":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-9","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/grading#алхмууд","content":"**Эхлүүлэх** дарна. Явц **дэвшилтийн мөр**-өөр харагдана (хуудас засварлах, тэмдэг таних,\nбөмбөлөг хэмжих гэх мэт үе шатууд). Энэ хооронд програм **царцахгүй**."},"307":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-10","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/grading#алхмууд","content":"Дуусахад нийт хуудас, дундаж оноо, **шалгах шаардлагатай** хуудасны тоо харагдана."},"308":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-11","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/grading#алхмууд","content":"> 📷 &#x2A;Дэлгэцийн зураг: Дүгнэх дэлгэц — файл сонголт, хувилбар, дэвшилтийн мөр.*"},"309":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-12","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/grading#итгэлийн-оноо-ба-шалгах-шаардлага","content":"Программ бөмбөлөг бүрийн дүүргэлтийг хэмжиж **итгэлийн оноо** тооцно. Хэрэв аль нэг бөмбөлгийн\nитгэл эргэлзээтэй мужид (хагас будсан) орвол тухайн хуудсыг **шалгах шаардлагатай** гэж\nтэмдэглэнэ. Эдгээрийг Гараар шалгах дэлгэцэд засна."},"310":{"id":"/en/docs/user/grading-13","page_id":"/en/docs/user/grading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/grading#зөвлөмж","content":"Сканнердах чанар үр дүнд шууд нөлөөлнө — Сканнердах зөвлөмж-ийг үзнэ үү."},"311":{"id":"/en/docs/user","page_id":"/en/docs/user","type":"page","content":"Introduction","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User Manual"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user"},"312":{"id":"/en/docs/user-0","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user","content":"shalgalt-omr — grade OMR answer sheets fully offline."},"313":{"id":"/en/docs/user-1","page_id":"/en/docs/user","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user#shalgalt-omr--user-manual","content":"shalgalt-omr — User Manual"},"314":{"id":"/en/docs/user-2","page_id":"/en/docs/user","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user#where-to-start","content":"Where to start"},"315":{"id":"/en/docs/user-3","page_id":"/en/docs/user","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user#privacy","content":"Privacy"},"316":{"id":"/en/docs/user-4","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user#shalgalt-omr--user-manual","content":"**shalgalt-omr** reads and grades OMR (fill-the-bubble) answer sheets automatically,\n**fully offline**, on your own computer. As a teacher you can:"},"317":{"id":"/en/docs/user-5","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user#shalgalt-omr--user-manual","content":"**Design a template** — draw the answer-sheet layout in a visual editor."},"318":{"id":"/en/docs/user-6","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user#shalgalt-omr--user-manual","content":"**Generate a printable PDF** of that template."},"319":{"id":"/en/docs/user-7","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user#shalgalt-omr--user-manual","content":"**Grade** scanned or phone-photographed sheets automatically."},"320":{"id":"/en/docs/user-8","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user#shalgalt-omr--user-manual","content":"**Review** low-confidence sheets by hand."},"321":{"id":"/en/docs/user-9","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user#shalgalt-omr--user-manual","content":"**Export** results to Excel, or share a whole project as a `.shalgalt` file."},"322":{"id":"/en/docs/user-10","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user#shalgalt-omr--user-manual","content":"> The interface of the application itself is in **Mongolian only**. This English manual is a\n> translation of the Mongolian user guide; some pages may fall back to Mongolian until their\n> translation is added."},"323":{"id":"/en/docs/user-11","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user#where-to-start","content":"First time? → Quick start."},"324":{"id":"/en/docs/user-12","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user#where-to-start","content":"A specific feature → Editor, Exams,\nGrading, Manual review, Export,\nProject files."},"325":{"id":"/en/docs/user-13","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user#where-to-start","content":"Printing / phone-scanning tips → Printing, Scanning."},"326":{"id":"/en/docs/user-14","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user#where-to-start","content":"Something went wrong → Troubleshooting."},"327":{"id":"/en/docs/user-15","page_id":"/en/docs/user","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user#privacy","content":"The app needs **no internet** and sends **nothing** anywhere. Student data stays on your\ncomputer. See the Privacy statement."},"328":{"id":"/en/docs/user/printing","page_id":"/en/docs/user/printing","type":"page","content":"Хэвлэх зөвлөмж","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User Manual","Tips"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/printing"},"329":{"id":"/en/docs/user/printing-0","page_id":"/en/docs/user/printing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/printing","content":"Хариултын хуудсыг зөв хэвлэх — цаас, бэх, масштаб."},"330":{"id":"/en/docs/user/printing-1","page_id":"/en/docs/user/printing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/printing#хэвлэх-зөвлөмж","content":"Хэвлэх зөвлөмж"},"331":{"id":"/en/docs/user/printing-2","page_id":"/en/docs/user/printing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/printing#хэвлэх-зөвлөмж","content":"Хариултын хуудсыг зөв хэвлэх нь автомат таних чанарт шууд нөлөөлнө."},"332":{"id":"/en/docs/user/printing-3","page_id":"/en/docs/user/printing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/printing#хэвлэх-зөвлөмж","content":"**Масштаб 100%.** \"Fit to page\" / \"хуудсанд багтаах\" сонголтыг **унтраа**. Багасгаж/томруулж\nхэвлэвэл бөмбөлгийн байрлал зөрж таних алдаа гарна."},"333":{"id":"/en/docs/user/printing-4","page_id":"/en/docs/user/printing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/printing#хэвлэх-зөвлөмж","content":"**Тод хар бэх, хангалттай тонер.** Бүдэг хэвлэлт булангийн ArUco тэмдгийг таниулахад хүндрэл\nучруулна."},"334":{"id":"/en/docs/user/printing-5","page_id":"/en/docs/user/printing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/printing#хэвлэх-зөвлөмж","content":"**Цагаан, гялбаагүй (matte) A4 цаас.** Өнгөт эсвэл гялгар цаас сканнердахад туссан гэрэл\nүүсгэж болзошгүй."},"335":{"id":"/en/docs/user/printing-6","page_id":"/en/docs/user/printing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/printing#хэвлэх-зөвлөмж","content":"**Хуудсыг бүтнээр нь хэвлэ** — 4 булангийн тэмдэг бүгд гарсан эсэхийг шалга."},"336":{"id":"/en/docs/user/printing-7","page_id":"/en/docs/user/printing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/printing#хэвлэх-зөвлөмж","content":"Олон хувь хэвлэхдээ нэгийг туршиж сканнердан үзээд дараа нь олноор хэвлэвэл найдвартай."},"337":{"id":"/en/docs/user/privacy","page_id":"/en/docs/user/privacy","type":"page","content":"Нууцлалын мэдэгдэл","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User Manual","Tips"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/privacy"},"338":{"id":"/en/docs/user/privacy-0","page_id":"/en/docs/user/privacy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/privacy","content":"Ямар ч мэдээлэл гадагш илгээдэггүй — бүрэн офлайн."},"339":{"id":"/en/docs/user/privacy-1","page_id":"/en/docs/user/privacy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/privacy#нууцлалын-мэдэгдэл","content":"Нууцлалын мэдэгдэл"},"340":{"id":"/en/docs/user/privacy-2","page_id":"/en/docs/user/privacy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/privacy#нууцлалын-мэдэгдэл","content":"shalgalt-omr нь **нууцлалыг эн тэргүүнд** тавьсан, бүрэн офлайн программ юм."},"341":{"id":"/en/docs/user/privacy-3","page_id":"/en/docs/user/privacy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/privacy#нууцлалын-мэдэгдэл","content":"**Интернэт шаарддаггүй.** Дүгнэх, хадгалах, гаргах бүх үйлдэл таны компьютер дээр явагдана."},"342":{"id":"/en/docs/user/privacy-4","page_id":"/en/docs/user/privacy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/privacy#нууцлалын-мэдэгдэл","content":"**Ямар ч мэдээлэл гадагш илгээдэггүй.** Телеметр, алдааны тайлан, аналитик **байхгүй**."},"343":{"id":"/en/docs/user/privacy-5","page_id":"/en/docs/user/privacy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/privacy#нууцлалын-мэдэгдэл","content":"**Сурагчдын мэдээлэл зөвхөн локал** өгөгдлийн санд хадгалагдана."},"344":{"id":"/en/docs/user/privacy-6","page_id":"/en/docs/user/privacy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/privacy#нууцлалын-мэдэгдэл","content":"`.shalgalt` файлыг хуваалцахдаа **нууц үгээр шифрлэх** боломжтой. Шифрлэсэн үед ч төслийн\nерөнхий мэдээллийн (manifest) хэсэгт **хувийн мэдээлэл агуулагдахгүй**."},"345":{"id":"/en/docs/user/privacy-7","page_id":"/en/docs/user/privacy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/privacy#нууцлалын-мэдэгдэл","content":"Зөвхөн &#x2A;*локал бүртгэл (log)** хөтлөгдөж, тодорхой хэмжээнд эргэлдэж шинэчлэгдэнэ."},"346":{"id":"/en/docs/user/privacy-8","page_id":"/en/docs/user/privacy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/privacy#нууцлалын-мэдэгдэл","content":"> Автомат шинэчлэлт (auto-update) нь **анхдагчаар унтраалттай** тул офлайн орчинд ажилладаг\n> сургуулиуд ямар нэг сүлжээний хүсэлт хүлээж авахгүй. Та тохиргооноос гараар асааж болно."},"347":{"id":"/en/docs/user/project-files","page_id":"/en/docs/user/project-files","type":"page","content":"Төслийн файл (.shalgalt)","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User Manual","Features"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/project-files"},"348":{"id":"/en/docs/user/project-files-0","page_id":"/en/docs/user/project-files","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/project-files","content":"Бүх шалгалтын төслийг нэг файлд хадгалах, хуваалцах, нээх."},"349":{"id":"/en/docs/user/project-files-1","page_id":"/en/docs/user/project-files","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/project-files#төслийн-файл-shalgalt","content":"Төслийн файл (`.shalgalt`)"},"350":{"id":"/en/docs/user/project-files-2","page_id":"/en/docs/user/project-files","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/project-files#онцлог","content":"Онцлог"},"351":{"id":"/en/docs/user/project-files-3","page_id":"/en/docs/user/project-files","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/project-files#нээх-ба-хадгалах","content":"Нээх ба хадгалах"},"352":{"id":"/en/docs/user/project-files-4","page_id":"/en/docs/user/project-files","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/project-files#жишээ-файлууд","content":"Жишээ файлууд"},"353":{"id":"/en/docs/user/project-files-5","page_id":"/en/docs/user/project-files","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/project-files#төслийн-файл-shalgalt","content":"`.shalgalt` файл нь **бүхэл шалгалтын төсөл**-ийг (загвар + хариултын түлхүүр + дүгнэсэн\nхуудаснууд + сурагчдын жагсаалт) нэг файлд багтаасан хэлбэр юм. Үүгээр та өөр компьютер\nруу зөөх, эсвэл хамтран ажиллагсадтайгаа хуваалцаж болно."},"354":{"id":"/en/docs/user/project-files-6","page_id":"/en/docs/user/project-files","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/project-files#онцлог","content":"Нэг файл, ердийн zip хэлбэртэй тул шифрлээгүй үед ямар ч zip програмаар нээж үзэж болно."},"355":{"id":"/en/docs/user/project-files-7","page_id":"/en/docs/user/project-files","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/project-files#онцлог","content":"**Нэмэлтээр нууцлах боломжтой** — нууц үг (passphrase) тавьж бүх агуулгыг шифрлэнэ."},"356":{"id":"/en/docs/user/project-files-8","page_id":"/en/docs/user/project-files","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/project-files#онцлог","content":"Гарчиг, огноо, хуудасны тоо зэргийг агуулсан **manifest хэсэг нь үргэлж задгай** байдаг тул\nнууц үг оруулахаас өмнө төслийн ерөнхий мэдээллийг урьдчилан харж болно. Энэ хэсэгт\nсурагчдын хувийн мэдээлэл **байхгүй**."},"357":{"id":"/en/docs/user/project-files-9","page_id":"/en/docs/user/project-files","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/project-files#нээх-ба-хадгалах","content":"**Нээх** — `.shalgalt` файл дээр давхар товшиход програм нээгдэж, шифрлэсэн бол нууц үг\nасууна. Агуулга нь таны локал санд сэргээгдэнэ."},"358":{"id":"/en/docs/user/project-files-10","page_id":"/en/docs/user/project-files","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/project-files#нээх-ба-хадгалах","content":"**Хадгалах / Гаргах** — төслөө `.shalgalt` болгон гаргахдаа нууц үг тавих эсэхээ сонгоно."},"359":{"id":"/en/docs/user/project-files-11","page_id":"/en/docs/user/project-files","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/project-files#нээх-ба-хадгалах","content":"> 📷 &#x2A;Дэлгэцийн зураг: Төсөл нээх — нууц үг асуух цонх.*"},"360":{"id":"/en/docs/user/project-files-12","page_id":"/en/docs/user/project-files","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/project-files#жишээ-файлууд","content":"Гурван бэлэн жишээ төслийг Жишээ файлууд хэсгээс татаж аваад туршиж үзэж\nболно (нээлттэй / шифрлэсэн / PDF-тэй)."},"361":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","type":"page","content":"Quick start","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User Manual"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start"},"362":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-0","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","content":"From installing the app to grading your first exam."},"363":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-1","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#quick-start","content":"Quick start"},"364":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-2","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#1-install","content":"1\\. Install"},"365":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-3","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#2-design-a-template","content":"2\\. Design a template"},"366":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-4","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#3-generate-a-printable-pdf","content":"3\\. Generate a printable PDF"},"367":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-5","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#4-create-an-exam-and-answer-key","content":"4\\. Create an exam and answer key"},"368":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-6","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#5-grade-the-sheets","content":"5\\. Grade the sheets"},"369":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-7","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#6-review-flagged-sheets","content":"6\\. Review flagged sheets"},"370":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-8","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#7-export-results","content":"7\\. Export results"},"371":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-9","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#quick-start","content":"This page walks you from **install → first template → first grade run**."},"372":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-10","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#1-install","content":"Download the build for your OS from the\nReleases page (Windows\n`.exe`/`.msi`, macOS `.dmg`, Linux `.AppImage`/`.deb`) and install it."},"373":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-11","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#1-install","content":"On first launch the database is created automatically on your computer. No setup needed."},"374":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-12","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#1-install","content":"> 📷 &#x2A;Screenshot: Dashboard (home). Checklist: `docs/user/screenshots-needed.md`.*"},"375":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-13","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#2-design-a-template","content":"On the **Dashboard**, click **New template** to open the Editor."},"376":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-14","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#2-design-a-template","content":"Place the four corner **ArUco markers** (provided by default)."},"377":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-15","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#2-design-a-template","content":"Add **bubble groups** for your questions (e.g. A–D), plus **Student ID** and **Variant**\ngroups if needed."},"378":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-16","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#2-design-a-template","content":"Click **Save**."},"379":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-17","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#2-design-a-template","content":"> 📷 &#x2A;Screenshot: Editor toolbar and a bubble group.*"},"380":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-18","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#3-generate-a-printable-pdf","content":"Click **Export PDF** in the editor to save a print-ready sheet. Mind the\nprinting tips (100% scale, solid black ink)."},"381":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-19","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#4-create-an-exam-and-answer-key","content":"Go to **Exams → New exam** and pick the template you just made."},"382":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-20","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#4-create-an-exam-and-answer-key","content":"Add an &#x2A;*answer key (variant)** to the exam — choose the correct answers by hand, or\n**scan** one filled sheet to read them in."},"383":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-21","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#4-create-an-exam-and-answer-key","content":"> 📷 &#x2A;Screenshot: Exam detail — editing the answer key.*"},"384":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-22","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#5-grade-the-sheets","content":"Open **Grade**."},"385":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-23","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#5-grade-the-sheets","content":"Select the scanned &#x2A;*PDF file(s)**."},"386":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-24","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#5-grade-the-sheets","content":"Choose which **exam / variant** to grade against (multi-variant auto-detect is available)."},"387":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-25","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#5-grade-the-sheets","content":"Click **Start**. Progress shows in a bar — the app never freezes."},"388":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-26","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#5-grade-the-sheets","content":"> 📷 &#x2A;Screenshot: Grade screen — file selection and progress bar.*"},"389":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-27","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#6-review-flagged-sheets","content":"When grading finishes, sheets that **need review** are flagged. Use the\nManual review screen to check bubbles one by one."},"390":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-28","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#7-export-results","content":"From **Results**, view the scores and click **Export to Excel**. See Export."},"391":{"id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start-29","page_id":"/en/docs/user/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/quick-start#7-export-results","content":"You can download the ready-made sample projects to try these steps."},"392":{"id":"/en/docs/user/review","page_id":"/en/docs/user/review","type":"page","content":"Гараар шалгах","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User Manual","Features"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/review"},"393":{"id":"/en/docs/user/review-0","page_id":"/en/docs/user/review","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/review","content":"Эргэлзээтэй хуудсуудыг бөмбөлөг бүрчлэн нягтлан засах."},"394":{"id":"/en/docs/user/review-1","page_id":"/en/docs/user/review","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/review#гараар-шалгах","content":"Гараар шалгах"},"395":{"id":"/en/docs/user/review-2","page_id":"/en/docs/user/review","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/review#алхмууд","content":"Алхмууд"},"396":{"id":"/en/docs/user/review-3","page_id":"/en/docs/user/review","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/review#зөвлөмж","content":"Зөвлөмж"},"397":{"id":"/en/docs/user/review-4","page_id":"/en/docs/user/review","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/review#гараар-шалгах","content":"Дүгнэлтийн дараа **шалгах шаардлагатай** гэж тэмдэглэгдсэн хуудсуудыг энд гар аргаар\nнягталж засна."},"398":{"id":"/en/docs/user/review-5","page_id":"/en/docs/user/review","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/review#алхмууд","content":"Дүгнэлт дуусахад гарах холбоосоор, эсвэл тухайн ажлын (job) дэлгэцээс **Гараар шалгах**\nруу орно."},"399":{"id":"/en/docs/user/review-6","page_id":"/en/docs/user/review","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/review#алхмууд","content":"Зүүн талд хуудаснуудын &#x2A;*жижиг зураг (thumbnail)** жагсаалт харагдана."},"400":{"id":"/en/docs/user/review-7","page_id":"/en/docs/user/review","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/review#алхмууд","content":"Голд сонгосон хуудасны зураг дээр **бөмбөлгийн давхарга** харагдана. Бөмбөлгийг дарж\nтөлвийг солино: **будсан → хоосон → эргэлзээтэй**."},"401":{"id":"/en/docs/user/review-8","page_id":"/en/docs/user/review","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/review#алхмууд","content":"Шаардлагатай бол хуудасны **хувилбар**-ыг дахин сонгож зөв болгоно."},"402":{"id":"/en/docs/user/review-9","page_id":"/en/docs/user/review","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/review#алхмууд","content":"Засвар хийсний дараа тухайн хуудас **дахин дүгнэгдэнэ**. Эцэст нь **Хадгалах**."},"403":{"id":"/en/docs/user/review-10","page_id":"/en/docs/user/review","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/review#алхмууд","content":"> 📷 &#x2A;Дэлгэцийн зураг: Гараар шалгах — thumbnail жагсаалт, бөмбөлгийн давхаргатай зураг.*"},"404":{"id":"/en/docs/user/review-11","page_id":"/en/docs/user/review","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/review#зөвлөмж","content":"Зөвхөн **эргэлзээтэй** бөмбөлгүүдэд анхаарлаа хандуулна — програм аль нь эргэлзээтэйг\nялган тэмдэглэдэг."},"405":{"id":"/en/docs/user/scanning","page_id":"/en/docs/user/scanning","type":"page","content":"Сканнердах зөвлөмж","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User Manual","Tips"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/scanning"},"406":{"id":"/en/docs/user/scanning-0","page_id":"/en/docs/user/scanning","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/scanning","content":"Гар утас болон сканнераар хуудас авах — гэрэл, өнцөг, тохиргоо."},"407":{"id":"/en/docs/user/scanning-1","page_id":"/en/docs/user/scanning","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/scanning#сканнердах-зөвлөмж","content":"Сканнердах зөвлөмж"},"408":{"id":"/en/docs/user/scanning-2","page_id":"/en/docs/user/scanning","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/scanning#ерөнхий","content":"Ерөнхий"},"409":{"id":"/en/docs/user/scanning-3","page_id":"/en/docs/user/scanning","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/scanning#гар-утсаар-camscanner-гэх-мэт","content":"Гар утсаар (CamScanner гэх мэт)"},"410":{"id":"/en/docs/user/scanning-4","page_id":"/en/docs/user/scanning","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/scanning#сканнераар","content":"Сканнераар"},"411":{"id":"/en/docs/user/scanning-5","page_id":"/en/docs/user/scanning","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/scanning#сканнердах-зөвлөмж","content":"Хуудсыг гар утсаар буюу сканнераар авахдаа дараахыг анхаарвал таних чанар нэмэгдэнэ."},"412":{"id":"/en/docs/user/scanning-6","page_id":"/en/docs/user/scanning","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/scanning#ерөнхий","content":"**Жигд гэрэлтүүлэг.** Сүүдэр, гялбаа (туссан гэрэл) үүсгэхгүй байх. Цонхны гэрэл налуу\nтусвал сүүдэр үүсдэг."},"413":{"id":"/en/docs/user/scanning-7","page_id":"/en/docs/user/scanning","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/scanning#ерөнхий","content":"**Шулуун өнцөг.** Хуудсыг дээрээс нь, аль болох тэгш авна. Хазайсан зургийг програм\nтодорхой хэмжээнд засдаг ч хэт налуу нь алдаа өгнө."},"414":{"id":"/en/docs/user/scanning-8","page_id":"/en/docs/user/scanning","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/scanning#ерөнхий","content":"**Бүх 4 булан** зурагт багтсан байх ёстой — булангийн тэмдгүүд таних түлхүүр."},"415":{"id":"/en/docs/user/scanning-9","page_id":"/en/docs/user/scanning","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/scanning#гар-утсаар-camscanner-гэх-мэт","content":"**Баримт (document) горим**-оор авч, **PDF** хэлбэрээр экспортлоно."},"416":{"id":"/en/docs/user/scanning-10","page_id":"/en/docs/user/scanning","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/scanning#гар-утсаар-camscanner-гэх-мэт","content":"Боломжтой бол **өнгөт/саарал** хэвээр үлдээ — програм өөрөө хар-цагаан болгож боловсруулна."},"417":{"id":"/en/docs/user/scanning-11","page_id":"/en/docs/user/scanning","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/scanning#гар-утсаар-camscanner-гэх-мэт","content":"Хэт өндөр шахалт (compression) -аас зайлсхий; бөмбөлгийн ирмэг бүдгэрч болзошгүй."},"418":{"id":"/en/docs/user/scanning-12","page_id":"/en/docs/user/scanning","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/scanning#гар-утсаар-camscanner-гэх-мэт","content":"Олон хуудсыг **нэг PDF** болгон нэгтгэвэл нэг дор багцаар дүгнэхэд хялбар."},"419":{"id":"/en/docs/user/scanning-13","page_id":"/en/docs/user/scanning","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/scanning#сканнераар","content":"**200–300 DPI** хангалттай. Хэт өндөр DPI файлыг л томруулна, чанар нэмэгдэхгүй."},"420":{"id":"/en/docs/user/scanning-14","page_id":"/en/docs/user/scanning","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/scanning#сканнераар","content":"Хэвтээ/босоо чигийг хуудасны загвартай тааруул."},"421":{"id":"/en/docs/user/troubleshooting","page_id":"/en/docs/user/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"Алдаа засах ба түгээмэл асуулт","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User Manual","Tips"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/troubleshooting"},"422":{"id":"/en/docs/user/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/en/docs/user/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/user/troubleshooting","content":"Түгээмэл тулгардаг асуудлууд ба шийдэл."},"423":{"id":"/en/docs/user/troubleshooting-1","page_id":"/en/docs/user/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/troubleshooting#алдаа-засах-ба-түгээмэл-асуулт-faq","content":"Алдаа засах ба түгээмэл асуулт (FAQ)"},"424":{"id":"/en/docs/user/troubleshooting-2","page_id":"/en/docs/user/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/troubleshooting#хуудсыг-таниж-чадахгүй--булангийн-тэмдэг-олдсонгүй","content":"Хуудсыг таниж чадахгүй / булангийн тэмдэг олдсонгүй"},"425":{"id":"/en/docs/user/troubleshooting-3","page_id":"/en/docs/user/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/user/trouble